  "answer_text": "The URL you provided, **`www.home.fedex.com/express`** (or `home.fedex.com`), is the **internal intranet homepage** for FedEx employees (specifically tailored for the FedEx Express division). \n\n### Key Information About This Link:\n\n* **Restricted Access (Behind the Firewall):** You **cannot** access this website from a personal computer, mobile phone, or home Wi-Fi network. If you attempt to open it from outside the FedEx network, you will get a \"403 Forbidden\" error, a connection timeout, or a page load failure. \n* **How to Access It:** You must be on-site at a FedEx facility and connected directly to the internal FedEx network (such as using a work computer/thin client or an authorized company VPN) to open this page.\n* **What It Is Used For:** Once logged in on-site, FedEx employees use the search bar on this intranet homepage to type in \"keywords\" to jump to internal tools. Common keywords include:\n  * **\"Dimensions\" or \"Kronos\"** (to check schedules, view timecards, and edit hours)\n  * **\"Travelnet\"** (to access non-rev personal travel benefits)\n  * **\"Payroll\"** (to view pay stubs and tax documents)\n  * **\"Keyword\" search** for internal job postings, training modules, and policy handbooks.\n\n### How to Access Employee Tools From Home\nIf you are off-site and need to check your payroll, benefits, or schedule, you cannot use the `home.fedex.com` URL. Instead, you must use public-facing external employee portals:\n1. **Workday & Scheduling (PurpleID):** Most employees can access their schedule and corporate info externally using **[purpleid.okta.com](https://purpleid.okta.com)** or by downloading the Workday app on their phone.\n2. **My Payroll / Employee Self Service (ESS):** If you need to view paystubs or change tax forms from home, you must go through the external FedEx Employee Self Service portal or the ADP/Workday integration depending on your division (Ground, Express, or Freight). \n\n*If you are an active employee having trouble logging in or resetting your password, you will need to use a work computer at your station or contact your manager/HR help desk.*",
